<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GRAND SLAM CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GRAND SLAM CUP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results at the $6 million Grand Slam Cup tennis tournament on Thursday:</p>
<p>Boris Becker (Germany) beat Jakob Hlasek (Switzerland) 6-4 6-1  </p>
<p>Tim Henman (Britain) beat MaliVai Washington (U.S.) 7-6 (7-3) 6-3.</p>
</text>
